    "description": {
      "value": "The carved night hag's hand at the end of this sandalwood staff clutches a rough gem. The staff of the Dreamlands makes it easier to navigate and survive in the Dreamlands and recognize its denizens. When wielding the staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks while in the Dreamlands and to checks to Recall Knowledge about creatures with the dream trait. You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip daze 1st alarm, d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu, sleep 2nd phantasmal treasure, silence"
